<title>USA: DenAmerica Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>DenAmerica Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.01     loss	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net loss		     187     loss	   967</p>
<p> Revs			77,708		   20,839</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,399		    6,938</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.08     loss	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net profit		   969     loss	   393</p>
<p> Revs		     241,480		   74,683</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,784		    6,938</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>1996 results reflect 53-week year; 1995 was 52-week year.</p>
<p>1995 results only for Denwest Restaurant Corp, which merged in March 1996 with American Family Restaurants to form Den America.</p>
<p>1996 results include one-time $3.0 million charge that include merger-related costs.</p>
</text>
